# Root build context (docker-compose builds the backend with `context: .`
# because its Dockerfile copies backend/ and tools/). Everything else is
# excluded so a build does not ship the 6.4 GB library, the benchmarks, the
# weights or the git history to the daemon (audit follow-up 3.6b, 2026-10-08).
.git
.gitignore
library/
omr-weights/
benchmarks/
data/
docs/
out/
frontend/
scripts/
*.md
.venv*/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/node_modules/
**/.pytest_cache/
backend/tests/
backend/uploads/
backend/exports/
backend/*.db*
backend/.env*
tools/omr/training/data/
tools/omr/tests/
